-- [automaticity-systems.md → implicit social learning](automaticity-systems.book-chapter.md#b-implicit-social-statistical-learning--reduced) — eye contact as a deliberately-learned, non-native skill; the cost-direction case, distinct from the orientation-direction read here.
-- [people-arent-safe.md](people-arent-safe.book-chapter.md) — the root wound the directness channel runs through; why the same gaze cuts in one frame and heals in another.
