-- [receiving-positive-signal.md](receiving-positive-signal.book-chapter.md) — the reception-side asymmetry that turns on this wall: criticism installs without the bridge, while the *benefit* of appreciation may require the very bridge the aphantasia removed, so positive signal may be structurally harder to receive than negative is to install.
-- [hypnagogic-imagery.md → semantic intent](hypnagogic-imagery.book-chapter.md#the-control-is-semantic-intent-not-a-volume-knob) — a fourth permeability instance, adding to concept→body (the [disgust reflex](missing-simulator.book-chapter.md#the-resolution--the-reflex-fires-with-no-simulator-running), ~10–20% live strength, and the deliberate ["Robot mode"](robot-mode.book-chapter.md)) and concept→emotion: in the hypnagogic dimmer the wall briefly thins enough for the always-lit conceptual side to reach across and **seed sensory imagery** by semantic intent — concept→sensory-imagery, the one channel otherwise fully sealed while awake. Mechanism lives there.
