-- [connection-dosing.md](connection-dosing.book-chapter.md) — connection as a rate-control problem: the dose that pays the debt down without crashing the recovery that makes connection affordable.
-- [connection-efficacy-model.md](connection-efficacy-model.book-chapter.md) — the 14-factor model that scores how many connection-hours an interaction pays down; the fidelity gate that decides how much of the physiological debt a source pays, keyed on sensory fidelity rather than realness of mind.
-- [being-known-cost.md](being-known-cost.book-chapter.md) — the Connection tank as a model-update operation the other person runs, and what it costs them to keep their model of me current.
-- [cross-gender-interaction-map.md](cross-gender-interaction-map.book-chapter.md) — the bright-line rules governing cross-gender interaction, an accommodation for missing real-time judgment.
-- [connection-expansion.md](connection-expansion.book-chapter.md) — the map of directions for paying the debt down.
-- [solitude-experiment.md](solitude-experiment.book-chapter.md) — the currently-running operating belief: the opposite of loneliness is solitude; withdraw attention from the deficit and watch three readouts.
-- [being-known-supply.md](being-known-supply.book-chapter.md) — who *can and will* close the Being-Known gap (the can × willing × cheap × expensive decomposition), and the committed plan: therapy with an autism-specialist near-twin.
-- [allostatic-load.md](allostatic-load.book-chapter.md) — connection deficit as the largest remaining source of allostatic load; the health motivation for closing the Being-Known gap.
-- [conceptual-adapters.md](conceptual-adapters.book-chapter.md) — commitment's adapter holds Alan to his relationships in place of the [attachment he cannot form](present-tense-model.book-chapter.md#no-attachment--structurally-not-as-a-failure-of-caring).
-- [central-loneliness.md](central-loneliness.book-chapter.md) — the deepest form of the being-known gap: the marriage's most central truth (how his love is constructed) is the one truth he must keep from Jen, leaving him alone at the center. Survived by non-salience, the law of emotional physics, and the 10x retirement-headroom anchor.
-- [regulated-anchor-exposure.md](regulated-anchor-exposure.book-chapter.md) — the forward path for the channel that physiologically counts: co-regulated exposure with Jen, against the [criticism alarm](criticism-and-ostracism.book-chapter.md) that guards it.
-
