-- [cross-gender-interaction-map.md](../cross-gender-interaction-map.book-chapter.md) — the canonical naming of **autistic context-independence**; Hypothesis B applies the same trait to threat-learning as the over-generalizer that would broaden the scar past the witness-driven model.
-- [people-arent-safe.md → the survival equation predates its content](../people-arent-safe.book-chapter.md#the-survival-equation-predates-its-content) — the sequential hit-then-spread reads onto the installer/content factoring: a few real installations (the art class one of them), each then bled wide by context-independence.
