-- [emotion-model.md → brushstrokes, not paintings](emotion-model.book-chapter.md#brushstrokes-not-paintings) — the present-bound waking emotion the dream state inverts: in dreams the full emotional score assembles.
-- [missing-simulator.md](missing-simulator.book-chapter.md) — the simulator that does not run awake is exactly what runs in dreams; dreams locate the absence at the waking-recall stage rather than in the simulator hardware.
-- [allostatic-load.md](allostatic-load.book-chapter.md) — bedtime cortisol, the master-load variable, tracked at night by nightmare frequency.
-- [sleep.md](sleep.book-chapter.md) — the protocol that defends sleep against the same load.
