-- [insight-and-restructuring.md → naming is the compression completing](insight-and-restructuring.book-chapter.md#naming-is-the-compression-completing) — the rule the naming of elevation is a live demonstration of; the morning's tool applied to a live emotion by the same evening.
-- [ritual-two-channels.md → the borrowed-sentiment proxy](ritual-two-channels.book-chapter.md#the-gap-fills--a-borrowed-sentiment-proxy-witness-gated) — the *affection* branch of the same amplifier, aimed at loved ones' live ritual-enjoyment.
-- [emotion-model.md](emotion-model.book-chapter.md) — Alan's basic/compound emotion palette; elevation is a distinct named emotion tied to the caring amplifier rather than a present-cue primary or compound, so it homes here.
