-- [compression-epistemology.md](compression-epistemology.book-chapter.md) — compression is the only channel from past to present; the truth-gauge and the storage-format are one thing; the anomaly explanatory-debt mechanism and "understanding is how you forget" are the compression-side account of what writes to the map.
