-
-## Systems
-
-- [conceptual-adapters.md](conceptual-adapters.book-chapter.md) — the deliberate compensation for an affectively flat map: building actionable definitions ("adapters") for concepts he cannot feel his way into, and commitment as the adapter that holds him in place of the attachment he cannot form.
-- [broad-learning.md](broad-learning.book-chapter.md) — "read authors, not books" is the in-place-merge learning operation: assimilate a believed-true worldview into the one model rather than storing it as a separately-queryable author.
