-- [non-habituation.md](non-habituation.book-chapter.md) and [learned-response-taxonomy.md](learned-response-taxonomy.book-chapter.md#a-second-axis--does-a-response-fade-with-repetition-and-by-which-machine) — why repetition alone is not an available engine.
-- [creativity-scars.md](creativity-scars.book-chapter.md) — the still-buried domain (hand-making) whose scar this model prices; the two-layer anatomy.
