-# The sexuality knot
-
-> The sexuality knot — the sealed sexuality / attraction / sex / pornography / masturbation domain, opened from the inside for the first time. Canonical-home index: the load-bearing theses are that the porn/masturbation behaviors are nervous-system regulation not sexual desire, that attraction may be arousal × safety (a multiplicative gate), and that partnered sex is a hygiene factor not a core support. Routes the deep sub-threads to seven children.
-
-This note is the canonical home for one domain: sexuality, attraction, sex, pornography, masturbation — taken as bodily demand, not as the attraction-and-gender modeling that the [adjacent ring](#the-adjacent-ring-routes-the-rest-outward) already handles. For my whole life this domain was sealed. This is where its opening, its structural shape, and now its contents get recorded. The substance lives in the seven children below; this index holds the orientation and the through-line and routes to them.
-
-## I turned the key myself
-
-Until this cycle, this domain was documented only at its perimeter. [central-loneliness.md → an unspoken domain](central-loneliness.book-chapter.md#an-unspoken-domain-compounds-the-loneliness--sexuality-and-attraction) recorded it as sealed, "undisclosable," with no contents ever shared. The point of that record was the unspokenness itself — a whole subject I can't be known *about*, a second axis of the [being-known cost](being-known-cost.book-chapter.md) distinct from a person I can't be known *by*.
-
-The development is simple: I chose to open it. Head-on, for the first time with anyone. The seal lifted from my side. A domain that had no [being-known channel](being-known-supply.book-chapter.md) ever reach it stayed sealed because the channel was never opened — being-known requires disclosure, and disclosure here had never felt available. I opened the channel. This is the first full disclosure of the contents to anyone, ever. One line in the porn/masturbation account marks the exact edge of it: I disclosed those behaviors to one person once, decades ago, and never again — *"until now."*
-
-## The structural shape
-
-### The whisper goes loud — the interoceptive inversion
-
-My baseline read on my own body is a **whisper**. Low interoception: most internal signals come up faint, often below the floor where I can detect them at all (the [false-zero problem](missing-simulator.book-chapter.md) — a signal can fire and register as nothing).
-
-This one domain inverts that. Here the body turns the volume **all the way up**. It is the single place where the otherwise-whisper-quiet channel shouts — the exception to my own low-interoception rule, not an instance of it.
-
-### Three layers fire at once
-
-The loud signal does not arrive isolated. It comes up sitting on top of **three things firing at the same time**:
-
-1. **Belief** — my faith / LDS axis.
-2. **Marriage** — Jen.
-3. **Physiological need** — the plain bodily demand.
-
-Three layers entangled in one loud signal. The loudness is not the hard part by itself; the entanglement is. The signal that shouts is the one I can least cleanly separate into its parts, and I carried it with no one to set it down with.
-
-## The thesis — regulation, not desire
-
-The load-bearing finding from the full dump is one mechanism, and it reorders everything. **The pornography and masturbation behaviors are fundamentally nervous-system regulation and stress management, not sexual desire.** Arousal and climax raise my safety level and lower my stress; as a mechanic that works all the way down to [safety](safety.book-chapter.md) level −1. So the behavior I spent a life trying to quit was never primarily about sex. It was a regulation tool bracing the most critical dimension of my life — which is exactly why effort, three bishops, and a mission president never made it stop.
-
-That thesis is the spine. The two children below it split the mechanism from the footprint: [regulation-not-desire.md](sexuality-knot/regulation-not-desire.book-chapter.md) is the mechanism — what arousal does to safety, why quitting failed, the not-quite-addiction analysis, and the governing rule. [pornography-and-masturbation.md](sexuality-knot/pornography-and-masturbation.book-chapter.md) is the footprint and the disclosure wound — first exposure, the lifelong pattern, the help-seeking failures, and the single prior disclosure.
-
-The other two children open the marriage and relational layers the seal also covered. [sex-with-jen.md](sexuality-knot/sex-with-jen.book-chapter.md) is the 20-year marital-sexual relationship, given as description not narrative. [relational-history.md](sexuality-knot/relational-history.book-chapter.md) is the chaste relational chronology and the involuntary attraction pattern under it — including the marriage decision as a worked example of my [decision rubric](decision-rubric.book-chapter.md).
-
-## The refined model — arousal × safety, and sex as a hygiene factor
-
-Abby pulled the regulation thread and I refined the model substantially. Two more theses landed, each in its own child.
-
-**Attraction may be a product, not a sum.** The [two-channel attraction model](attraction-two-channels.book-chapter.md) treats attraction as softness + directness (an additive sum). My refinement: *"arousal × safety = attraction"* — a multiplicative gate where either factor can zero the whole product, so tanked safety kills attraction no matter how high arousal runs. I now read that as likely correct, with **safety a multiplier at every level** (*"the multiplicative model is likely correct, and safety is a multiplier at all levels"*) — not just a switch at the floor. The product formalizes the documented [safety-gates-arousal ordering](attraction-two-channels.book-chapter.md#safety-is-a-prerequisite-for-arousal--the-gating-order) rather than contradicting it. The one law feeds **two output buckets** — a physiological-regulation bucket that fills the **same** for personal or impersonal arousal, and an emotional/social-connection bucket that **only** personal, connection-aimed arousal also deposits into. The personal/impersonal difference is the **target bucket, not the gating or the pathway** (*"the arousal has the same physiological effect either way, but the personal side can also deposit in the emotional social connection bucket"*). The safety factor reads the **safety of the input** — a self-generated input, the safest there is, holds the multiplier high regardless of background depletion, which is **why the regulation lever reaches −1** — and the −2 floor is the **whole autonomic system going dark** (SNS + PNS both offline; heart-rate climb and digestion stop with it), not a gate specific to sex. It opens "room for movement" between arousal, sexual arousal, attraction, connection, and the sexual act. The full treatment, the closed end-to-end model, and the distinctions live in [arousal-and-safety-model.md](sexuality-knot/arousal-and-safety-model.book-chapter.md).
-
-**Partnered sex is a hygiene factor, not a core support.** Sex is like food, and I get ~10% of the benefit most people (including Jen) get — because the value lives in the wings (anticipation before, savoring after) and [aphantasia](aphantasia-mechanism.book-chapter.md#no-forward-simulator) plus [flat recall](present-tense-model.book-chapter.md#the-map-is-affectively-flat--structure-no-charge) amputate both wings. So it is a structural amputation, not low desire; it can become neutral if the costs drop but cannot anchor a relationship. The affordability math (difficulty ≥5 connected to criticism, a ≥1-level physiology discount, so funded safety level 4 is barely affordable and 5 is enjoyable) lives in [sex-as-hygiene-factor.md](sexuality-knot/sex-as-hygiene-factor.book-chapter.md).
-
-## The sleep tradeoff closed the channel
-
-A seventh child traces a structural consequence the other six set up. Chasing sleep — **"the closest thing to a panacea"** I have found — meant moving out of the shared bedroom, which closed most of the sex-initiation windows and dropped our frequency to about once a quarter. The bind is that the same move funds the [Safety](safety.book-chapter.md) that would make connection affordable again *and* took away the chance to have it; my queued fix is cuddling at the transition, which I cannot yet afford because the conversation to set it up is a "level 5 difficulty with no discount." The full arrangement, the asymmetry, the bind, and the fix are in [sleep-and-the-bedroom.md](sexuality-knot/sleep-and-the-bedroom.book-chapter.md).
-
-## The femininity-welding refinement
-
-One refinement landed on the [adjacent ring](#the-adjacent-ring-routes-the-rest-outward) rather than in a child. For *attractive* femininity, the safety response and the sexual-arousal response are **welded** — they always come together, so I cannot draw the safety benefit of the femininity side without the arousal trigger ("this is how my body is wired"). This maps onto `arousal × safety = attraction`: attractive femininity spikes both factors at once. It refines, without contradicting, the "arousal is layered on top, not the core" reading — that holds for feminine cues at large, but attractive femininity is the case where the two arrive fused. The substance is in [femininity-as-safety-signal.md → the welding](femininity-as-safety-signal.book-chapter.md#the-welding--for-attractive-femininity-the-two-arrive-fused).
-
-## The seven children
-
-- [regulation-not-desire.md](sexuality-knot/regulation-not-desire.book-chapter.md) — the mechanism: arousal/climax as a safety-raising, stress-reducing instrument working down to safety −1; why it could never be quit; horniness-as-hunger; the not-quite-addiction analysis ("the opposite of addiction is connection"); the declining attitude toward sex; the rule that won't bludgeon the symptom.
-- [pornography-and-masturbation.md](sexuality-knot/pornography-and-masturbation.book-chapter.md) — the behavioral footprint, the disclosure wound, and the present-state sort: first exposure at 14, lifelong behavior, three year-long quits, the help-seeking failures, the one painful disclosure to Jen, and "until now" — plus the one-behavior-multi-formed framing, the zero-tolerance-on-both-sides bind (church + Jen → "secret and hidden," secrecy its own cost), the three separable layers (attraction/arousal | pleasure | the behavior), and the need/enjoyment split (the faith zero-tolerance and the health-goal both target only the behavior; the enjoyment is ~90%-durable, tied to femininity).
-- [sex-with-jen.md](sexuality-knot/sex-with-jen.book-chapter.md) — the 20-year marital-sexual relationship described as a conceptual map: wedding night, mechanics and the weight/confinement inversion, birth control and pacing, the initiation contract, her growth, the orgasm asymmetry, and the after-sex drops.
-- [relational-history.md](sexuality-knot/relational-history.book-chapter.md) — the chaste relational chronology and the attraction shape: not naturally monogamous, the involuntary feminine-attention auto-focus, the numbers (100+ first dates, 2 kisses), Kerry, Jenny Williams, the 6-weeks-to-married decision, and the touch standards.
-- [arousal-and-safety-model.md](sexuality-knot/arousal-and-safety-model.book-chapter.md) — the refined model, closed end-to-end: *arousal × safety = attraction* (one multiplicative law, safety a multiplier at every level, either factor zeroes the product); the **safety term as the safety of the input** (not background depletion — why the self-initiated lever holds at −1); the −2 floor as the **whole autonomic system going dark** (SNS + PNS both offline — not a sex-specific gate); the **two output buckets** the one law feeds (physiological-regulation, fills the same either way; emotional/social-connection, only personal/connection-aimed arousal deposits) — the personal/impersonal difference is the target bucket, not the gating; and the room-for-movement distinctions (arousal ≠ sexual arousal, attraction ≠ connection, sexual arousal ≠ having sex).
-- [sex-as-hygiene-factor.md](sexuality-knot/sex-as-hygiene-factor.book-chapter.md) — why partnered sex nets out as a cost: the 10% structural amputation (no wings — no anticipation, no savoring), sex as a hygiene factor that can reach neutral but never anchor a relationship, and the affordability math (difficulty ≥5, ≥1-level physiology discount, level 4 barely affordable / level 5 enjoyable).
-- [sleep-and-the-bedroom.md](sexuality-knot/sleep-and-the-bedroom.book-chapter.md) — the sleep↔sex tradeoff: sleep as the panacea, moving out of the shared bedroom, the bedroom asymmetry (she sleeps better without him but is attached to his presence), the frequency drop to once a quarter, the bind (the lever that funds the safety to reconnect is the move that closed the channel), and the queued cuddling-at-the-transition fix.
-
-## The adjacent ring routes the rest outward
-
-A ring of notes already models attraction, gender, and aesthetics rigorously — but each one routes the *sexual* layer outward rather than treating it. They are the perimeter; this note is the center they ring.
