+- [no-deliberate-mode.md → the map is the motor](no-deliberate-mode.book-chapter.md#right-is-true--the-map-is-the-motor) — the canonical home for the no-akrasia claim (knowing→doing, the middle term collapsed out); this note supplies its mechanistic proof (the paradox argument).
+- [environment-lever.md](environment-lever.book-chapter.md) — the build-it-or-it-disappears lever that gap kind 2 is the gap-side view of.
