+- [action-epistemology.md](action-epistemology.book-chapter.md) — why building can be how understanding completes (the both-at-once case).
+- [self-improvement.md → the self is the map](self-improvement.book-chapter.md#confirmed--the-self-is-the-map-in-identity-not-utility) — the ontology that makes understanding-fully identical to being-changed.
