+- [conceptual-adapters.md](conceptual-adapters.book-chapter.md) — commitment's adapter ("never fail silently") holds Alan to his relationships in place of the emotional attachment he cannot form.
+- [closeness-paradox.md](closeness-paradox.book-chapter.md) — a candidate relationship-timescale mechanism behind the ~10:1 asymmetry: a per-person damage ledger (good-intent corrections laying down triggers) accruing faster than the per-person safety ledger. Whether it is the primary or a minor driver of connection cost is open (see thread below).
