+- [present-tense-model.md → the map is affectively flat](present-tense-model.book-chapter.md#the-map-is-affectively-flat--structure-no-charge) — why Alan's own recall could not carry the magnitude claim; the contemporaneous external log does, because the reconstructed map is flat and present-tense.
+- [stress-responses.md](stress-responses.book-chapter.md) — the nonexistence-ideation longing window the 80% counts; the bearable/unbearable crossing that generates it.
