+- [aphantasia-mechanism.md](aphantasia-mechanism.book-chapter.md) — the Recall break that removes the sensory-memory substrate; this note is its emotional-channel consequence.
+- [present-tense-model.md](present-tense-model.book-chapter.md) — the same present-only restriction at the level of the whole mind; the emotional narrative shares the present-only shape.
+- [missing-simulator.md](missing-simulator.book-chapter.md) — the unifying frame underneath: the disgust anomaly is the loose thread that resolves into a single missing component, the same one that confines the narrative to the present.
+- [empathy-alexithymia-paradox.md](empathy-alexithymia-paradox.book-chapter.md) — in-moment empathy survives because it runs on the present-moment sensation channel, not on the missing narrative substrate.
+- [dreams.md](dreams.book-chapter.md) — proof the encoding is intact and only waking Recall fails: asleep, the full emotional score the present-bound waking system cannot run assembles freely.
+- [alexithymia.md → the invisible emotional reservoir](alexithymia.book-chapter.md#the-invisible-emotional-reservoir) — emotions encoded continuously but undischarged awake; the hypothesized store of feeling behind the Recall break.
+- [safety.md → proof as the prosthetic](safety/aphantasia-constraint.book-chapter.md#proof-as-the-prosthetic-for-the-missing-senses) — why felt hope being unavailable forces proof to carry weight forward, and why recovery (inductive only) can't reach proof-grade weight.
+- [regulated-anchor-exposure.md](regulated-anchor-exposure.book-chapter.md) — the backward half worked through: forgetting the cost of a bad conversation decays the danger-memory and causes re-injury.
+- [emotional-archaeology.md](emotional-archaeology.book-chapter.md) — comprehension as the *door* into a feeling reframes the thoroughness of the five-step dig: understanding isn't the price of mercy, it's the only entrance to feeling anything about an unreplayable past.
+- [perfection-is-safe.md → post-archaeology](perfection-is-safe.book-chapter.md#the-reflex-still-fires-but-the-belief-is-withdrawn--post-archaeology) — the forgiveness whose receipt the grief is; grief as the verdict changing from *guilty* to *hurt*.
+- [alexithymia.md → naming the feeling and reporting the empty well is the read](alexithymia.book-chapter.md#naming-the-feeling-and-reporting-the-empty-well-is-the-read) — why accurately reporting "no more here right now" is the emotional-read skill, not a failure of it.
