+- [connection-dosing.md](connection-dosing.book-chapter.md) — the dose discipline the governed expansion runs under; the [above-the-line backfire](connection-dosing.book-chapter.md#above-the-safety-line-the-bid-doesnt-fail--it-backfires) that makes "kept below the line" load-bearing.
+- [volatility-governor.md → the gate opens too soon](volatility-governor.book-chapter.md#the-gate-opens-too-soon-not-too-late) — why May went ungoverned: the governor fails open, no experiential memory of the burn, no dread-brake (the aphantasia inversion).
+- [fun.md](fun.book-chapter.md) — the for-its-own-sake definition the categorical shift in play satisfies.
+- [safety.md → safety is a funded level](safety.book-chapter.md#safety-is-a-funded-level-not-a-per-alarm-switch) — the unifying mechanism the persona-ramp is one instance of: the personas don't mute a fear, they raise the funded Safety level until it clears the play's exposure-rung, which is what makes the play affordable. Same dynamic as the [creativity-scar two-layer model](creativity-scars.book-chapter.md#the-two-layer-model--an-exposure-rung-floor-plus-a-welded-belief) and the singing scaffold.
+- [values-personas-system.md](values-personas-system.book-chapter.md) and [values-personas-system/closeness-practice-rig.md](values-personas-system/closeness-practice-rig.book-chapter.md) — the personas the outward focus runs to; the ramp-across-a-gap structure the play-as-ramp finding mirrors.
