+- [conceptual-cognition.md](conceptual-cognition.book-chapter.md) — the childhood precocity (algebra + computers in preschool, fourth-grade-plus readiness a year young) as the earliest instances of the conceptual-cognition profile.
+- [connection.md → childhood connection was easy](connection.book-chapter.md#childhood-connection-was-easy--an-early-datum) — the inverted early datum against the current adult connection arc.
+- [broad-learning.md](broad-learning.book-chapter.md) — voracious childhood reading as the root of the read-authors broad-intake practice.
+- [slow-build-strategy.md → sequential life arcs](slow-build-strategy.book-chapter.md#sequential-life-arcs) — the same span read as strategy (meta-learning decade, harness arc), not as a timeline.
+- [personal-context.md](personal-context.book-chapter.md) — snapshot facts about the present household and infrastructure, not a narrative.
+- [self-chosen-difficulty.md](self-chosen-difficulty.book-chapter.md) — the substantive treatment of the College chapter: autonomy as driver, self-chosen difficulty, the hard-course sensing-network.
