+- [self-optimization-in-burnout.md](self-optimization-in-burnout.book-chapter.md) — the lived, felt face of this measurement: the unmatched self-optimization Alan ran while the resiliency was falling (undiagnosed, ~80% suicidal, ~two decades), the AutCon frontier as its first outside proof, and coming out of hell holding the relief.
