+
+- [criticism-and-ostracism.md](criticism-and-ostracism.book-chapter.md) — the most-developed specialization: the alarm this prior fires as on a social-rejection cue.
+- [gender-dysphoria-mechanism.md](gender-dysphoria-mechanism.book-chapter.md) — the macho-coded branch and the structural parallel that explains *why* illegibility draws punishment.
