+- [creativity-scars.md](creativity-scars.book-chapter.md) — the creativity scars are a content-attachment point on this prior: the art class (age ~12) bolted creativity content onto an equation already running for a dozen years; the survival equation predates the creativity content.
+- [perfection-is-safe.md → survival stakes are the installer](perfection-is-safe.book-chapter.md#survival-stakes-are-the-installer--an-inescapable-undeniable-judge) — the installer mechanism read from the other side: the installer *is* this survival equation, and later judgments bolt their content onto it rather than creating it.
