+- [being-known-supply.md → the monopoly](being-known-supply.book-chapter.md#the-monopoly--one-maximum-stakes-node) — why the exposure can't be routed around: Jen is the single maximum-stakes node, and the alarm is conditioned to her specifically.
+- [recovery-ladder.md](recovery-ladder.book-chapter.md) — connection (being-known) is the current critical-path reach; this exposure is how the rung gets climbed against the alarm guarding it.
