+- [safety/extinction-model.md](safety/extinction-model.book-chapter.md) — the model reframes this exposure: timing the conversation for when reserve is high is one concrete way to hold the **breach rate** low (keep the adverse draw below the Safety line) while the center rises — the practical instrument for the rate-held-for-a-duration condition extinction needs.
+- [volatility-governor.md](volatility-governor.book-chapter.md) — the reserve-reading discipline (don't initiate when depleted) is the same governor applied to the connection channel.
+- [connection-expansion.md → real-time being-known](connection-expansion.book-chapter.md#real-time-being-known--the-audio-only-channel) — the audio-only modality that breaks the visual stress-feedback amplifier; the channel optimization the exposure rides on.
