+- [creativity-scars.md](../creativity-scars.book-chapter.md) — the scar this model now also governs: creativity-exposure extinguishes only from above the Safety line (the level-4 vulnerability floor), and below it reinforces; the safety condition on the exposure-therapy new-behavior.
