+- [conceptual-adapters.md → the adapter inventory](conceptual-adapters.book-chapter.md#the-adapter-inventory) — self-worth's place among the adapters, and the build-method engine it ran on.
+- [identity-collapse.md](identity-collapse.book-chapter.md) — the collapse the adapter was compiled inside.
+- [self-preservation-adapter.md](self-preservation-adapter.book-chapter.md) — the sibling adapter from a different crisis two years later; the old others-rule that shared the same carve-out shape.
+- [journey-as-reward.md → the biographical root](journey-as-reward.book-chapter.md#the-biographical-root--why-the-wanting-rule-exists) — the childhood belief the syllogism broke.
+- [emotional-archaeology.md → the worked example](emotional-archaeology.book-chapter.md#the-worked-example--the-childhood-needs-belief) — the belief-replacement method that worked the same childhood belief from the origin side.
+- [receiving-positive-signal.md](receiving-positive-signal.book-chapter.md) — the verdict-gate working synthesis: positive signal must clear a verdict Alan already holds about himself to land, so outside praise can't install worth where he doesn't already grant it — the same gap this adapter has (it conditions worth, never asserts it), reframed as how reception works.
