+- [femininity-as-safety-signal.md](../femininity-as-safety-signal.book-chapter.md) — the canonical home for the femininity-tied attraction/enjoyment (layers 1–2): why the enjoyment is durable and may grow as safety rises, and the [welding](../femininity-as-safety-signal.book-chapter.md#the-welding--for-attractive-femininity-the-two-arrive-fused) of arousal to attractive femininity.
