+- [safety.md](../safety.book-chapter.md) — the funded-Safety / affordability model the bind and the queued conversation both run on.
+- [love-construction.md → what "care" means](../love-construction.book-chapter.md#what-care-means--an-emotion-independent-verdict) — the non-standard, emotion-independent sense of "care" that drives the fix toward Jen's need rather than my own payoff.
