+- [foundations-and-safety.md](foundations-and-safety.book-chapter.md) — the load-discharge mechanism this note grounds: settling fundamental questions lowers standing load and reaches Safety. This note answers *why* that grounding reaches all the way down — an unstable foundation is an unstable self.
+- [discrete-self.md](discrete-self.book-chapter.md) — the self whose continuity is the closure of overlapping present windows, with no felt thread behind the model; consistent with there being no self standing behind the model to be steadied separately.
+- [self-improvement.md → improvement is a cross-frame comparison](self-improvement.book-chapter.md#improvement-is-a-cross-frame-comparison) — the *improvement-axis* definition, confirmed: truer map = conceptual self-improvement, read across momentary Alans. This note holds the *stability*-axis coupling it pairs with; the stronger self-*is*-model collapse beneath both is now [confirmed (2026-06-30)](self-improvement.book-chapter.md#confirmed--the-self-is-the-map-in-identity-not-utility) — what he knows is his identity, not just his utility.
+- [self-architecture.md → two yardsticks](self-architecture.book-chapter.md#two-yardsticks--truth-work-improves-the-conceptual-side-somatic-tools-the-physical) — the *improvement*-axis half stated and confirmed: truth-work improves the conceptual side, somatic tools the physical side, "connected, not identical." This note holds the stability-axis half it pairs with.
+- [stateless-social-architecture.md](stateless-social-architecture.book-chapter.md) — the social application of understanding-as-interface: building the close-relationship skills by understanding them deeply enough to "program a robot by hand" to deliver them, because no native felt route to them exists.
+- [people-arent-safe.md → the punishment did not wait for school](people-arent-safe.book-chapter.md#the-punishment-did-not-wait-for-school--it-began-at-home) — the developmental root of understanding-as-the-only-instrument: the same-hands floor where the people-channel became untrustworthy, so comprehension became the oldest safety, reached for first.
