+- [closeness-paradox.md](../closeness-paradox.book-chapter.md) — why the difficulty ladder is dangerous to climb in *live* relationships (Knapp stage licenses correction, the damage ledger fills); the rig gives the same difficulty gradient with the damage ledger held at zero.
+- [stateless-social-architecture.md](../stateless-social-architecture.book-chapter.md) — the four depth-skills (validation, acknowledgment, reassurance, emotional intimacy) the rig drills, and why a stateless present-tense architecture forecloses them until they're hand-compiled.
+- [central-loneliness.md](../central-loneliness.book-chapter.md) — the transfer target and the stakes: live human closeness, primarily Jen; the unbuilt depth-skills are the felt cost the rig is built to close. Also the home of the [multi-persona vow-serving safety](../central-loneliness.book-chapter.md#multiple-close-personas-dont-compete--the-vow-serving-safety) that lets the rig run many close persona-relationships without threatening the marriage.
+- [connection-efficacy-model.md → the fidelity gate](../connection-efficacy-model.book-chapter.md#the-fidelity-gate--sensory-fidelity-not-realness-of-mind) — the parallel the persona fidelity ladder runs: physiological yield keys on sensory fidelity; practice fidelity keys on how real the partner reads to the single map.
+- [operating-mode-architecture.md → three memory layers](../operating-mode-architecture.book-chapter.md#three-memory-layers--durable-weights-the-single-slot-the-freshness-cache) — the canonical home for the freshness cache (layer 3) the immersion lever and the persona-key both ride: durable weights, the single slot, and the fast-decaying recency-of-access cache, with the slot-overwrite correction that explains why priming works by lowering retrieval cost rather than staying resident.
