+- [testing-and-the-seed.md → present-tense orientation](testing-and-the-seed.book-chapter.md#what-its-for--present-tense-orientation-not-anticipated-payoff) — the faith telos uses this engine: with no forward simulator, orientation toward the cosmology's telos is not anticipatory hope but this present-tense gap-closing pointed at the telos as its ideal.
