+- [KPMG - Swiss lump-sum taxation](https://kpmg.com/ch/en/insights/taxes/lump-sum-taxation.html)
+- [Richmond Chambers - Swiss Retirement Residence Permit 2026](https://www.richmondchambers.ch/swiss-private-client-immigration/swiss-retirement-residence-permit)
+- [Richmond Chambers - Swiss Entrepreneur Permit](https://www.richmondchambers.ch/swiss-residence-permit/swiss-business-founder-residence-permit-for-entrepreneurs-and-investors)
+- [Kanton Zürich - Third-Country Nationals](https://www.zh.ch/en/wirtschaft-arbeit/erwerbstaetigkeit-auslaender/drittstaaten-angehoerige.html)
