+
+# Summary Observations
+
+## Standouts by credential bundle
+
+Installers combining longevity (10+ years), Utah DOPL licensed electricians, NABCEP-certified installers, A+ BBB plus 4.5+ on SolarReviews/EnergySage, and 10+ year workmanship warranty:
+
+- **Creative Energies Solar** — 21 years operating, B Corp, NABCEP, off-grid + storage capability. Highest stability bet.
+- **Intermountain Wind & Solar** — 17 years, 6,500+ installs, A+ BBB. Strongest install volume among Utah-only operators.
+- **Progressive Power Solutions** — 19 years, A+ BBB since 2008, NABCEP, master electricians.
+- **Apollo Energy** — Master-electrician heritage since 1999; 5.0 EcoWatch; strongest pick for electrically complex installs.
+- **Redstone Solar** — 4.9/5 SolarReviews, in-Provo, owner-operated, 25-year inverter warranty.
+- **ES Solar** — Highest Utah-HQ install volume (15K+); Rocky Mountain Power Wattsmart Battery partner; NABCEP.
+
+## Best workmanship warranty
+
+- **Smart Wave Solar** — 25-year workmanship (longest in market) + 25-year equipment.
+- **Project Solar** — Double-backed 25-year equipment and workmanship (including roof leaks from panels).
+
+## Best price-per-watt (cash buyer)
+
+- **Project Solar** — $1.61-$1.82/W full service; $1.26-$1.47/W DIY.
+- **Blue Raven Solar** — Aggressive volume pricing but new (2024) corporate parent.
+- **Tesla Energy** — Lowest national price-per-watt; local support quality varies.
+
+## Red flags — avoid
+
+- Defunct or bankrupt: **Lumio, Vision Solar, Go Solar Group, ADT Solar/Sunpro, Freedom Forever, Sunnova, Vivint Solar (absorbed into Sunrun)**.
+- License revoked: **Elan Solar / Colarusso Ventures**.
+- Recently closing: **G3 Solar, Mynt Solar, Auric Energy**.
+- Operating but complaint-heavy: **LGCY Power** (deceptive sales, oversized systems), **ION Solar** (2025 multi-month delays, missed ITC deadlines costing customers thousands, oversized non-net-metered systems despite local HQ).
+
+## Patterns observed
+
+- **Massive 2024-2025 consolidation wave.** SunPower Corp, Lumio, Vivint, Sunnova, ADT/Sunpro, Freedom Forever, Vision Solar all exited within 24 months. Five had major Utah operations. The growth-via-debt residential solar model collapsed when ITC step-downs were proposed and door-to-door sales costs caught up to margins.
+- **Door-to-door sales is the single strongest predictor of complaints.** Every installer with widespread complaints about misrepresented tax credits, oversized systems, or unaffordable 25-year loans uses a 1099 commissioned sales force (Lumio, Vision Solar, LGCY, Sunder, Freedom Forever, ION's recent volume). Referral-driven installers (Creative Energies, PPS, Redstone) have far fewer complaints.
+- **Lease/PPA in Utah is economically poor.** Rocky Mountain Power's Customer Generation Program credits exports far below retail, so TPO savings models don't pencil the way they do in CA/MA. Cash or solar loan with ownership captures the 30% federal ITC and full self-consumption value. Avoid Sunrun lease/PPA, Sunnova, and Sunder TPO offerings.
+- **Provo is the gravitational HQ of US residential solar.** ION (Provo), Blue Raven (Orem), Sunder (South Jordan), Vivint (Lehi), Lumio (Lehi), LGCY (Lehi), Mynt (Lehi), Project Solar (Lehi), Redstone (Provo), Creative Energies (SLC). The BYU-returned-missionary sales pipeline is the historical driver.
+- **NABCEP certification is necessary but not sufficient.** Lumio installers were NABCEP-certified. Verify Utah DOPL E200/E201 license status, BBB complaint trend over the last 12 months (not the 10-year average), and request three references from installs completed within the last 6 months in your specific city.
+
+## Recommended shortlist for 1350 Apple Ave
+
+By credentials + proximity + complaint trend + warranty:
+
+1. **Creative Energies Solar** — stability, battery, commercial-grade install
+2. **Redstone Solar** — proximity (2 mi), owner-operated, 25-year inverter warranty
+3. **Intermountain Wind & Solar** — install volume + Wasatch Front depth
+4. **ES Solar** — Wattsmart Battery partnership if storage is priority
+5. **Progressive Power Solutions** — NABCEP + 19-year track record (verify active status)
+6. **Smart Wave Solar** — longest workmanship warranty
+7. **Project Solar** — lowest transparent pricing + double-backed warranty
+8. **Ask Solar Mike** — Tesla Powerwall 3 with local support
+
+Get quotes from at least 3, verify Utah DOPL license at [dopl.utah.gov](https://dopl.utah.gov/), request 3 last-6-month references in Provo / Orem, and confirm whether Solar Insure or equivalent third-party workmanship insurance is bundled.
